import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 474 | Infinite Terror · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Stage Setting Collapse and Combat-Power Inflation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 474 | Infinite Terror · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Stage Setting Collapse and Combat-Power Inflation","no":474,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Infinite Terror","Retcon","Combat-Power Inflation","Plot Kidnaps Setting"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Division"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0474_模块2-无限恐怖-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定崩坏与战力膨胀.md","filePath":"en/0474_模块2-无限恐怖-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定崩坏与战力膨胀.md"}'),a={name:"en/0474_模块2-无限恐怖-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定崩坏与战力膨胀.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,u,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-474-infinite-terror-·-retcon-ending-analysis-late-stage-setting-collapse-and-combat-power-inflation" tabindex="-1">Entry 474 | Infinite Terror · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Stage Setting Collapse and Combat-Power Inflation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-474-infinite-terror-·-retcon-ending-analysis-late-stage-setting-collapse-and-combat-power-inflation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 474 | Infinite Terror · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Stage Setting Collapse and Combat-Power Inflation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Infinite Terror Decomposition (Entry 7) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 19, 14</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-outside-the-box-there-is-another-box-becomes-the-universal-patch" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when &quot;outside the box there is another box&quot; becomes the universal patch <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-outside-the-box-there-is-another-box-becomes-the-universal-patch" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when &quot;outside the box there is another box&quot; becomes the universal patch&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — has a strict definition of &quot;retcon&quot;: early iron laws broken by late plot convenience, settings yielding to emotion, new explanations overturning old without notifying readers. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. <em>Infinite Terror</em> as infinite-flow&#39;s founding work, its late collapse has paradigm significance.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Retcon itself is the biggest energy waste — early carefully built rules discarded, equivalent to all &quot;reader trust&quot; in early part zeroed at once. Zheng Zha rose from China Team squad leader all the way to &quot;Saint-tier&quot;; his energy-level jump curve had rules to follow early, late completely serves &quot;this chapter must win.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Infinite-flow as a genre, its retcon is structural:</p><ol><li><strong>Instances infinite</strong>: theoretically movies, novels, games, real events can all be instances; the author cannot build self-consistent rules for each instance.</li><li><strong>Combat power infinitely inflating</strong>: instances stronger and stronger; protagonist must follow; once protagonist strong, early enemies become jokes.</li><li><strong>Truth infinitely nested</strong>: above the Main God are Saints; above Saints is the box; above the box is the author — each new box opened, all prior &quot;answers&quot; invalidated.</li></ol><p>This &quot;infinite&quot; genre is by design at war with &quot;setting self-consistency.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zheng Zha&#39;s &quot;strength&quot; less and less comes from cultivation, more and more from &quot;plot needs.&quot; He begins able to defeat opponents he could not possibly win early, not because he did something, but because the author needs him to win. This is the most hidden predation — <strong>predating readers&#39; trust in the narrative contract that &quot;hard work gets strong.&quot;</strong> When readers find Zheng Zha wins not because he did something right, but because the author needs him to win, all the early tension about &quot;life-death fight&quot; invalidates.</p><p>Infinite-flow as a genre, its retcon has another structural root: <strong>it has no &quot;cosmos ceiling.&quot;</strong> Any finite cosmos (e.g., Douluo, Shrouding the Heavens), even if late collapses, at least has one &quot;cosmos&quot; as backstop; but infinite-flow from the start has no cosmos — it only has &quot;the next instance.&quot; No cosmos, no law; no law, no self-consistency. This is the genre&#39;s original sin.</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s diagnosis of infinite-flow: it is not that it cannot write well, but its genre structure itself is at war with &quot;setting self-consistency.&quot; To make infinite-flow not collapse, must first give it a cosmos — a cosmos with boundaries, laws, institutions, then let &quot;infinite&quot; unfold inside this cosmos. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Multiverse Realm, Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, is precisely this &quot;bounded infinity&quot;: it can infinitely expand, but expansion goes in appendices, does not overturn old settings. Infinite-flow if accepts this transformation, can turn from &quot;infinite retcon&quot; to &quot;infinite expansion without collapse.&quot; This is the law-first axiom&#39;s universal value for all long-form cosmoses.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Infinite-Flow Retcon</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>New instance = new rules</td><td>Law-first: laws precede; instances do not legislate</td></tr><tr><td>Combat power inflates with plot</td><td>Nine realms + two realms fixed framework; promotion goes public procedure</td></tr><tr><td>Truth infinitely nested</td><td>Settings public and transparent; no hidden boxes</td></tr><tr><td>Old settings yield to new plot</td><td>Old settings never overturned; additions go in appendices</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist halo universal</td><td>Plane-Transcendent four-dimensional exam; winning depends on contribution</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain freezes <em>Infinite Terror</em>&#39;s early rules (Genetic Lock stage 1 to 3, point exchange list, instance difficulty curve) as &quot;baseline laws,&quot; then lets subsequent plot deduce under this frozen law. Result shows: if early rules held, Zheng Zha around the thirtieth instance would hit an &quot;unbreakable difficulty wall&quot; — this is not a bad thing, but law&#39;s normal constraint on plot. The original&#39;s collapse precisely because the author refused to admit this wall, and bypassed it by &quot;opening a new box.&quot;</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. Early medium, late low; after Box Theory layer upon layer, overall untrustworthy</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely high</strong>. Sequels, fan works, crossover works number in hundreds; original late settings rewritten repeatedly</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong>. Zheng Zha&#39;s victories more and more depend on plot rather than rules</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: early rules discarded = early trust zeroed</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: predating readers&#39; narrative trust</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s system at least did not retcon; infinite-flow has retcon in its genes</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: retcon only serves protagonist; instance supporting cast are only consumables</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: outside the box another box always opens; settings never stable</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p><em>Infinite Terror</em> founded a genre, also demonstrated this genre&#39;s death. When &quot;infinite&quot; means &quot;any rule can be covered by new rules,&quot; it can never have a truly stable cosmos. What Heng Yuan Zhou needs to do is change &quot;infinite&quot; from &quot;infinite retcon&quot; to &quot;infinite expansion without collapse&quot; — relying on the law-first axiom.</p><p>In the final analysis, Infinite Terror · retcon-ending analysis · late-stage setting collapse and combat-power inflation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./468_模块2-无限恐怖-总论郑吒与轮回收割体系定性.html">Entry 468 · Overview</a> · <a href="./475_模块2-无限恐怖-设定自洽度评估-中低自洽度.html">Entry 475 · Setting Self-Consistency Assessment</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Division</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
